  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hydro-powered Pumping Solutions for Farmers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">aQysta provides sustainable hydro-powered pumping solutions for farmers, to source water and to irrigate the land. The product makes use of purely the power of running water in a nearby (small) river to pump water to the land. aQysta&#x2019;s entity in India, Mumbai, is next to conducting local sales mainly responsible for the global sourcing and production of the company&#x2019;s main product, the Barsha Pump. The DGGF loan made it possible to produce Barsha pumps at the aQysta facility in India, purchase parts for this, and to ship the pumps to clients located in Mongolia. A total of 20 pumps have been produced. With this project 2 direct FTE and indirect 14 FTE have been supported.</narrative>
  </description>
